                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.00/2861: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-09-18T17:00:00-04:40"><hi rendition="#italic">September 18,
                                1924—5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received September 19—9:30
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>55. Provisions of the Plan of the Evacuation have been completed and all of the
                    Forces of Occupation have left the country.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
